{"title": "Bhaalist Ritual Target (Condition)", "pageid": 40202, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bhaalist_Ritual_Target_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Threat Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Generic_Threat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Bhaalist Ritual Target</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>As part of the challenge to enter the temple, the affected entity has become the target of a chanting cultist, the Farslayer, who can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/25px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/38px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/50px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/25px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Power_Word_Kill_Ritual\" title=\"Bhaal's Power Word Kill Ritual\">Bhaal's Power Word Kill</a> once its profane ritual ends. Exiting the Farslayer's chanting range of 55 m (183 ft) makes you invulnerable to the effect. Slaying the Farslayer stops the ritual and wins the conflict. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_BHAALCULTIST_SNIPING_TARGET</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_BHAALCULTIST_SNIPING_TARGET%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_BHAALCULTIST_SNIPING_TARGET%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><